+3. Perform CP decomposition on $\mathbf{G}_{noisy}$ with rank $R$:
+   $$ \mathbf{G}_{noisy} \approx \sum_{r=1}^{R} \mathbf{f}_0^{(r)} \otimes \mathbf{f}_1^{(r)} \otimes \mathbf{f}_2^{(r)} \otimes \mathbf{f}_3^{(r)} \otimes \mathbf{f}_4^{(r)} $$
